### Disc Golf Bag Tips API — sample requests
### Usable with the IntelliJ HTTP client or the VS Code REST Client extension.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = local-dev-token

### Pipeline readiness — is the catalog synced, are the models configured?
GET {{host}}/api/v1/status

### Type-ahead disc search (backs the front end's disc picker)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/discs/search?q=buzz&limit=10

### One disc by catalog id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/discs/aa24b5ff-cd19-5c17-9d1c-15b8ff270032

### Plastic blends for one manufacturer (includes the cross-brand fallbacks)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/plastics?brand=Discraft

### The main event — analyse a bag and recommend the next disc
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [
    { "name": "Aviar", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "DX", "weightGrams": 175, "wear": "BEAT_IN" },
    { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "ESP", "weightGrams": 177, "wear": "SEASONED" },
    { "name": "Leopard3", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "Star", "weightGrams": 172, "wear": "NEW" },
    { "name": "Teebird", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "Champion", "weightGrams": 175, "wear": "NEW" }
  ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
    "throwingStyle": "FOREHAND",
    "courseType": "WOODED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "WINDY" }
}

### The same bag with nothing but molds — every optional axis omitted
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [
    { "name": "Aviar", "brand": "Innova" },
    { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft" },
    { "name": "Leopard3", "brand": "Innova" },
    { "name": "Teebird", "brand": "Innova" }
  ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
    "throwingStyle": "FOREHAND",
    "courseType": "WOODED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "WINDY" }
}

### Wear in action: the only overstable driver has been beaten into a straight disc.
### The analysis should report an overstable gap the published flight numbers cannot see.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [
    { "name": "Aviar", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "DX", "weightGrams": 175 },
    { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "ESP", "weightGrams": 177 },
    { "name": "Firebird", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "DX", "weightGrams": 173, "wear": "WELL_WORN" }
  ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
    "throwingStyle": "FOREHAND",
    "courseType": "MIXED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "WINDY" }
}

### A beginner with almost nothing, on an open course
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [ { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "Pro-D", "weightGrams": 180 } ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "BEGINNER",
    "throwingStyle": "BACKHAND",
    "courseType": "OPEN"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "NORMAL" }
}

### An empty bag — the recommendation targets a first disc rather than a gap
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "BEGINNER",
    "throwingStyle": "BACKHAND",
    "courseType": "MIXED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "COLD" }
}

### Bag models that could hold an 18-disc lineup
GET {{host}}/api/v1/bags?capacity=18

### Bag models from one manufacturer
GET {{host}}/api/v1/bags?capacity=10&brand=Innova

### Lineup including carry weight and bag fitting
POST {{host}}/api/v1/lineup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [
    { "name": "Aviar", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "DX", "weightGrams": 175 },
    { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "ESP", "weightGrams": 177 },
    { "name": "Teebird", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "Champion", "weightGrams": 175 }
  ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
    "throwingStyle": "FOREHAND",
    "courseType": "WOODED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "WINDY" },
  "carriedBag": { "brand": "GRIPeq", "model": "G-Series" }
}

### Brands available for the filter control
GET {{host}}/api/v1/brands

### Same gap, but only recommend discs from brands the player already throws
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [
    { "name": "Aviar", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "DX" },
    { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "ESP" },
    { "name": "Teebird", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "Champion" }
  ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
    "throwingStyle": "FOREHAND",
    "courseType": "WOODED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "WINDY" },
  "filters": {
    "brands": ["Discraft", "Dynamic Discs"],
    "maxSpeed": 9
  }
}

### The whole bag slot by slot — putter / midrange / fairway / distance
POST {{host}}/api/v1/lineup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [
    { "name": "Aviar", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "DX", "weightGrams": 175, "wear": "BEAT_IN" },
    { "name": "Buzzz", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "ESP", "weightGrams": 177 },
    { "name": "Teebird", "brand": "Innova", "plastic": "Champion", "weightGrams": 175 }
  ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "INTERMEDIATE",
    "throwingStyle": "FOREHAND",
    "courseType": "WOODED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "WINDY" }
}

### Re-read this session's last recommendation (needs the session cookie from a previous call)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/recommendations/latest

### Save a bag without asking for a recommendation
POST {{host}}/api/v1/session/bag
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bag": [ { "name": "Zone", "brand": "Discraft", "plastic": "Z" } ],
  "profile": {
    "skillLevel": "ADVANCED",
    "throwingStyle": "BOTH",
    "courseType": "MIXED"
  },
  "conditions": { "weather": "HOT" }
}

### What this session has stored
GET {{host}}/api/v1/session

### Forget everything for this session
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/session

### Admin: pull the DiscIt catalog now instead of waiting for 03:15 UTC
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/catalog/sync
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Admin: embed the discs whose vectors are missing or stale
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/embeddings/backfill?limit=200
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Admin: vector coverage for the active embedding model
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/embeddings/stats
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Circuit breaker state
GET {{host}}/actuator/circuitbreakers
